  <div class="eyebrow">System Design Case Study</div>
  <h1>Designing a Sharded Database with <em>Consistent Hashing</em> that survives adding and losing nodes.</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">A complete high-level design walkthrough: requirements, capacity estimation, architecture, data model, and three deep dives into the hardest problems: the hash ring with virtual nodes, rebalancing without downtime, and replication with failure handling.</p>
  <div class="hero-meta">
